{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265nkZGAmaN81794991670.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案續審。</p><p></p><p>下午的聆訊，鄺港智代表大律師繼續盤問鄺球，質疑他作為前警察，聽到兒子稱有嚴重情況，卻只叫對方到大美督停車場會合，情況不合常理。鄺球回應說，當時未能判斷事件嚴重程度。現在同意，當時蔡天鳳需要醫生和救護車。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.C.CHOI.PM 1600_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026SpJexCyUKR1794992010.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>鄺港智一方提出，鄺球因蔡天鳳平時經常對其不禮貌等，挑起鄺球情緒並導致其爆發。鄺球不同意，又指對屍體做出的行為都是為了「維護兩個仔」，並深信有用，又否認涉襲擊蔡天鳳。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.C.CHOI.PM 1600_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026da2lyXe5is1794992025.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>鄺球指，2009年前已每月定期匯錢回港主控郭莎樂質疑，其妻李瑞香2017年曾破產，但鄺球仍然有大額消費，包括買名車。另外鄺港智當年聲稱因缺錢而犯案，與鄺球有定期匯錢回港的説法有矛盾。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T09:43:58.169661+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":291,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T08:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T23:17:32.795894+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T09:37:15.769079+00:00","content_hash":"9577b7c24b0a96749b6886355dc222be166b6dea48ffbacb960d938fbf90217c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T09:43:58.169661+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}